      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Agreed. A forced hamburger menu, to start, that requires hold down tab and while holding it, dragging your cursor over to the hamburger menu to interact with it isn't it. We do need to both move *and* remove elements at our discretion. Especially with different screen sizes, including ultrawide monitors.\n\nThe current alternative without this implemented is going to be avatars using up more material slots, unique shaders, and animator layers to put your mute icon and other elements actually where you want them on the screen without the HUD enabled.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-09-10T00:04:45.151Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Allow players to have the ability to further customize the HUD. This HUD is WIP of course but it be nice if we were to be allowed to reposition and resize the HUD elements in the screen.\n\nAn unofficial HUD made by ikeiwa (IKEHud) does this.",
